WEBVTT

00:10:28.542 --> 00:10:34.042
But there is nothing abstract
or sentimental about an Irish wake.

00:10:34.792 --> 00:10:36.434
The old woman in the box,

00:10:36.458 --> 00:10:40.351
that red-haired child
wrapped up in a shroud

00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:42.393
is another dead human.

00:10:42.417 --> 00:10:44.125
Another one of us.

00:10:44.958 --> 00:10:46.434
Wrapped up, though,

00:10:46.458 --> 00:10:49.893
in these corpse encountering rituals

00:10:49.917 --> 00:10:52.934
are a lot of profound protocols.

00:10:52.958 --> 00:10:55.542
You see, at that wake --

00:10:56.417 --> 00:10:58.809
You know, this is what death looks like.

00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:00.768
This is what death is.